# The end of the first quest (#155): the old book's remedy brings the lantern
# back. Played by the SupperSpot (his round table) once he's had the spicy
# tomato soup you set down by him while he was low. Placeholder writing:
# rewrite freely.
#
# He drinks in its steam; amber climbs back up through the blue, the crack
# in his glass closes, and his eyes open. Only now does he speak. The
# captain, by his fire the whole time, says what he says.

~ start
@shot lantern_table
@wait 1.5
@look lantern mended
clear lantern_low
@wait 1.4
@look lantern pleased
lantern: There you are.
lantern: You were in the water. I pulled. You held on. Good holding.
lantern: I'll get you home. I know exactly where it is. Roughly.
@face heron lantern
heron: Hm. Soup.
@shot free
